@startuml
title Liste laden

actor Nutzer
participant ListView
participant SubscriptionService

box "Repository Interfaces"
  participant SubscriptionRepository
  participant ProviderRepository
  participant CategoryRepository
end box

participant "REST-Implementierungen" as REST
participant Backend

Nutzer -> ListView: Liste öffnen
ListView -> SubscriptionService: execute()

SubscriptionService -> SubscriptionRepository: findAll()
SubscriptionRepository -> REST: findAll()
REST -> Backend: Abos laden
Backend --> REST: Subscription-DTOs
REST --> SubscriptionRepository: DTOs
SubscriptionRepository --> SubscriptionService: DTOs

par Provider und Kategorien
  SubscriptionService -> ProviderRepository: findAll()
  ProviderRepository -> REST: findAll()
  REST -> Backend: Provider laden
  Backend --> REST: Provider-DTOs
  REST --> ProviderRepository: DTOs
  ProviderRepository --> SubscriptionService: DTOs
else
  SubscriptionService -> CategoryRepository: findAll()
  CategoryRepository -> REST: findAll()
  REST -> Backend: Kategorien laden
  Backend --> REST: Category-DTOs
  REST --> CategoryRepository: DTOs
  CategoryRepository --> SubscriptionService: DTOs
end

SubscriptionService -> SubscriptionService: Subscription aus den drei DTOs zusammensetzen
SubscriptionService --> ListView: Subscription[]
ListView --> Nutzer: Liste anzeigen

@enduml
